iface_generator_inferred_error.vlt:9:5: error: this generator throws `Bad`, which its result type does not declare
the error type of an interface's iterator is part of its type, which is fixed before bodies are checked; declare it in the result: `Iterator<i64, Bad>` (and as the error type of the `Iterable` it implements), or catch the error in the generator
